flow/v2_pipeline/phase_05_leader/gemini_progress_run.log:15:Magpie_M1 is currently in the **Phase 2 (RTL/Integration)** and **Phase 3/4 (Lockstep/Coverage)** verification stages. We have successfully completed the structural bring-up of the 4-stage pipeline (Phase 1) and recently finalized the transition from fixed-latency memory interfaces to a production-ready **valid/ready memory wrapper** (Stage 2.1). While the core demonstrates high equivalence against the Spike golden model for a bounded set of random programs, the IP is **NOT yet qualified**. The current focus is on closing functional coverage gaps and initiating licensed EDA sign-off (Lint/PPA).
