codex
The bad `mtvec` value is coming from this firmware’s PC-relative `la` sequence, which resolves to `0x5c` on the DUT path while the label is `0x58`. For this directed trap test I’m going to make `mtvec` setup absolute to the local handler address; that removes harness ambiguity and lets the RTL trap semantics be tested directly.
apply patch
