The waveform now makes the remaining RTL bug clear: the WB `ex_wb_pc_r` used for synchronous exception `mepc` is one architectural instruction ahead in this pipeline. Saving it directly makes the handler skip the instruction that should run after the fault. I’m changing synchronous exception `mepc` to the faulting PC value used by this pipeline’s bookkeeping.
apply patch
